What do I do?!

29
00:01:16,333 --> 00:01:17,500
She's being kidnapped!

30
00:01:28,958 --> 00:01:31,958
The cell phone fell!

31
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:37,916
Hello, police?!

32
00:01:37,916 --> 00:01:39,500
My friend
She was kidnapped!

33
00:01:51,625 --> 00:01:52,541
Has Breno arrived yet?

34
00:01:52,958 --> 00:01:54,500
No, sir, he
it hasn't arrived yet.

35
00:01:54,666 --> 00:01:55,666
But this is not possible.

36
00:01:55,666 --> 00:01:57,291
By the time they should have arrived!

37
00:02:00,583 --> 00:02:03,291
Mrs. Camila still hasn't called home!

38
00:02:03,291 --> 00:02:04,916
She and Breno still
they did not arrive.

39
00:02:05,541 --> 00:02:06,791
What's going on?

40
00:02:11,416 --> 00:02:14,416
Answer, Camila...

41
00:02:14,583 --> 00:02:17,583
Camila doesn't understand...

42
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:22,458
Felipe, check what
is happening.

43
00:02:22,458 --> 00:02:23,333
They haven't arrived yet.
